 "_doc": "Musina Local Municipality eMunsoft 'TAX INVOICE / STATEMENT OF ACCOUNT': header (Account Number, Account Date, ERF Description, Street = site_name, Deposit), METER READINGS table and an ACCOUNT DETAILS ledger 'date code DESCRIPTION units @ tariff * value' followed by an undated VAT line. Two table prints: the current one (old/new reading, READING DATE = read_end, READING TYPE code A/I, consumption) and an older one (consumption, LEVIED AMOUNT, READING DATES period). Electricity = 'BASIC ELECTRICITY CHARGE' (other_r) + 'ELEC BUSINESS' (kWh, standard_r); values are ex VAT. Deposit adjustment lines are ignored. Two bills (the same November statement twice) show a meter roll-over (old reading above new), which the READ check flags - the bill's consumption is correct for a 6-digit wrap. Fingerprint: the municipality's VAT number + name/web domain. Identity (--identity mus_elec_check_r): units x printed tariff for both lines (mul) vs the printed values: 0.00 on 10/10. Checked on all 10 bills."
}